!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
Plain
description: the unquoted default — yaml/plain
- |
  `name: Rex` — the plain style, the default. It keeps YAML's plain-scalar limits: no
  `: ` or ` #` inside, a leading `- ` reads as a sequence marker, consecutive plain
  lines fold together — and in yamlover the pointer metacharacters join the list, each
  escaped with `\` where a literal one is meant
  ([escaping](::language:pointers:escaping)).
